~ start
TUTO-BAT: Hey you! Yes, you! I am called the TUTO-BAT.
I won’t give you any tutorials or anything… but I can give you a guidetorial!

So here we go.
You move around with WASD or the arrow keys. Basic, right?
You can skip dialogues by clicking with your mouse.

And the combat is pretty simple as well. You choose the enemy you want to attack, then you choose an attack you want to use.
After that, you have to quickly spell the name of the attack that is shown on the screen. The more correct letters you type, the more damage you deal.

After that, the enemy will attack. Once again — spelling time!
The more letters you spell correctly, the more damage you will defend against.

And that’s it! Now go and have fun!
=> END